sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Shopper
    participant W as Web
    participant A as Auth
    participant O as Orders
    U->>W: open checkout
    W->>A: verify token
    activate A
    A-->>W: token ok
    deactivate A
    loop every item
        W->>O: reserve item
        O-->>W: reserved
    end
    alt payment fails
        W-xU: show error
    else payment succeeds
        W->>O: confirm order
    end
    Note right of O: orders are idempotent
